  {
   "id": "katana-kata-126860@03.02",
   "gameId": "katana-kata-126860",
   "displayName": "Update 03.02",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-03-03T15:43:52.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This is a major update, addressing a high amount of refunds after deaths at a garden. It seems not a lot of players are ready to repeat their path from the beginning, so now Katana Kata has some kind of a difficulty choice - every time you go out from a home dojo, you can choose a level to start from (if you were there at least once of course). This will affect you ending - you can start from any level you like to explore and train, but true ending will wait for you only when you start your current run from a bath house.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Except for that, there are bosses now at the Castle level. They are in a test mode at the moment, so their attacks may change in future. And a final cutscene will be added after I balance this last boss fight.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope this will bring more players to Katana Kata,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
