  {
   "id": "katana-kata-126860@03.02.1",
   "gameId": "katana-kata-126860",
   "displayName": "Update 03.02.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-02-03T15:36:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Monk-boss on the waterfall level has been updated with a new ability - Iron skin. Whenever you damage his health, your weapon will take a big amount of damage. There will be plenty of spare basic weapons around him, so this fight should be a true test for all your skills - dodging, precise strikes and spirit management. In future Iron Skin might be added to other enemies to spice some places up (with different amount of durability damage). Since this is a big change in level balance, I will reset the leaderboard for Waterfall level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, I addressed smaller bug when buddha menu would not pause the game and not all of taken perks would be shown. This should work better now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
