      {
       "text": "There is proper restart after death in the home dojo, sorry if you encountered it and didn't know what to do",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Glitch when character would continue to run when you open Buddha menu or others, should be fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
