  {
   "id": "katana-kata-126860@31.01.1",
   "gameId": "katana-kata-126860",
   "displayName": "Update 31.01.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-01-31T12:37:18.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi! I know a lot of you are waiting for bugfix in general, but problems in the tutorial were keeping the new player from playing the game, so I hope you'll understand I must fix them first.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I rearranged the tutorial, so series stick became optional and appears after the sparring - when player already know all the basics, and can experiment with more advanced technique.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, I tried to address glitch when player would become frozen during fast series of attacks - I made a lot of tests after my fixes and never encountered it again, so if you still experience this behavior - please tell me.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And the smallest thing - I deactivate hiding interfaces on Tab, because it would be pretty confusing, especially if someone push the button randomly during the combat. I will improve this system and return it later.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for playing, I didn't forget about all the bugs and problems you reported earlier, these was just top priority with the fastest solution.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
