  {
   "id": "katana-kata-126860@30.01.1",
   "gameId": "katana-kata-126860",
   "displayName": "Update 30.01.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-01-30T11:54:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Change log",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Timing window for series of hit increased - now it should be easier to make a series. 25% of release time after attack available for a next strike",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nightmare is harder now - enemy is stronger and faster, so now it should be really challenging fight for your progress",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Health and spirit numbers were removed from enemies bars - they were not so informative and just spoiled overall picture",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A hero is wearing a hat and scarf now - because it's stylish :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Armored enemies became more resistant to damage through their blocks - if they have no spirit while blocking your attack, they get hit in the armor now, instead of direct health damage like others",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I am still working on some bugs with movement controller, like freezing when you click attacks too fast or draining spirit for dodge without actually dodging - those bugs are harder to find and fix, so I decided to deliver another improvements first.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
